# Copy to `api.env` on the server, chmod 600, never commit.
# Single file for the flashcards-api container (docker --env-file).

NODE_ENV=production
PORT=3000
JWT_SECRET=replace-with-openssl-rand-hex-32
CORS_ORIGIN=https://kzt24.duckdns.org

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Outgoing mail (one option — see priority in server/mailer.js)
# Direct SMTP from a random VPS IP is rejected by mail.ru, Gmail, etc. as spam.
# Use a trusted relay (A), Outlook/Gmail/Mail.ru SMTP (B–D), or local Postfix (E) with RELAY/SPF/DKIM.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# (A) Brevo — recommended: https://app.brevo.com  →  SMTP & API → create key
#     Verify sender in Brevo (domain or “From”) so MAIL_FROM is allowed.
#     If set, this overrides generic SMTP_HOST below.
# BREVO_SMTP_LOGIN=your-brevo-account@email.com
# BREVO_SMTP_KEY=xkeysib-...
# MAIL_FROM="Карточки" <noreply@yourdomain.com>
#
# (B) Outlook / Microsoft 365 — smtp.office365.com, 587, STARTTLS.
#     MAIL_FROM should match the same mailbox. Microsoft may require «SMTP AUTH» enabled
#     for the mailbox: https://aka.ms/smtp_auth_disabled (or Exchange admin: per-mailbox).
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.office365.com
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_SECURE=false
# SMTP_USER=you@outlook.com
# SMTP_PASS=your-password-or-app-password
# SMTP_TLS_INSECURE=false
# MAIL_FROM="Карточки" <you@outlook.com>
#
# (C) Gmail — needs 2-Step Verification + “App password” (not the normal login pass).
#     Otherwise Google returns 550 when sending *from* a VPS. MAIL_FROM must be this Gmail.
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_SECURE=false
# SMTP_USER=you@gmail.com
# SMTP_PASS=xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx
# SMTP_TLS_INSECURE=false
# MAIL_FROM="Карточки" <you@gmail.com>
#
# (D) Mail.ru — use “Пароль для внешнего приложения” in mailbox settings, then
#     from address must be that mailbox (or allowed alias).
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.mail.ru
# SMTP_PORT=465
# SMTP_SECURE=true
# SMTP_USER=you@mail.ru
# SMTP_PASS=external-app-password
# SMTP_TLS_INSECURE=false
# MAIL_FROM="Карточки" <you@mail.ru>
#
# (E) Local Docker Postfix (flashcards-postfix) — for production add RELAY, SPF, DKIM.
# SMTP_HOST=flashcards-postfix
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_TLS_INSECURE=true
# MAIL_FROM="Карточки" <noreply@kzt24.duckdns.org>
#
# (stub) If neither Brevo keys nor SMTP_HOST is set, codes go to: docker logs flashcards-api
